ll,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家拉麵店已經來訪很多次了，每次吃完都還是會想再回來，是我在台北少數會一直回訪的拉麵愛店。\n\n最喜歡的是他們的醬油拉麵，湯頭很順口，不會死鹹，也不會有那種喝幾口就膩的感覺。醬油的香氣很明顯，但整體還是很乾淨、平衡，麵條、舒肥肉和湯頭搭在一起都很舒服，是那種吃完會覺得滿足，但不會有負擔的味道。\n\n價格也算平實，以台北拉麵店來說很合理，份量跟品質都對得起價錢。店內環境乾淨，氣氛也很好，即使客人很多、店裡很忙，仍然能感受到店員的用心。店裡的人員不多，就三位，但每一位服務都非常好，而且不是制式的客氣，而是真的感覺得到他們對服務有熱情。這種繁忙卻依然有人情味的拉麵店，在台北真的難得一見🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻\n\n這次吃到季節限定的韓國牡春也很喜歡，味道剛剛好，不會太濃，湯頭很鮮甜，而且帶有滿明顯的米酒香氣，喝起來很有層次。因為是季節限定，不一定每次來都有，所以能吃到覺得很幸運。\n\n整體來說，是一間不只拉麵好吃，環境、價格和服務感受都很舒服的店。來訪多次，每次都有穩定的水準，算是偶然遇到之後就默默變成愛店的地方。",null,[0,45]]]],[null,1778466900000000,1778466900000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdi12cjVsM1g1ZHBET1JMM1dJbDFUZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfdi12cjVsM1g1ZHBET1JMM1dJbDFUZxoTQ2d3STFJQ0YwQVlRekpQZzhBSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjKubChxNKWAxUycvUHHeRrIIYQ_2MIVygJ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8339519429077637702/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0TTJWVVVuUmpSVnBxWTNreGNrOVlRbEZVYVRGcVRGWkNWRkZWUlJBQhAA"]